    "Use Spring's Environment and PropertySource abstraction to load external configuration file (YAML/Properties) for module overrides.",
    "Refactor CC SPI deployer to use Cloud Foundry Java Client (CF java-client) for improved design and performance.",
    "Implement Hadoop distribution selection via a configuration property that determines which Hadoop libraries are included in the classpath.",
    "Move header-enricher module from modules repo to XD core as a built-in module with no functional changes.",
