    "External config file overrides will be implemented using Spring's PropertySource abstraction.",
    "CC SPI deployer refactor will replace existing SPI implementation with CF java-client calls.",
    "Hadoop distribution choice will be implemented by adding a configuration property and adjusting classpath assembly.",
